{"parentUuid":"be152e70-a6d5-4776-a2b4-f48a1477da4a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CguYfakURhXJjhLKB655k","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HoeETt1LcNiMkhypyvAJRy","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr490_final.md","content":"## Summary\n\nA private npm workspace root only holds scripts and tooling, is never published, and nothing depends on it by version. A versioned root like `monorepo 0.0.0` showed up as a phantom package that `publish-to = [\"none\"]` could not hide. It is now skipped, with or without a version, unless a `[[package]]` block names it. `status` prints one note when it skips a root. Spec WS-DISC-08 is updated.\n\nKnown limit: the note prints on every command that loads the workspace, and `init` prints it more than once, like the existing note for a Cargo crate with no version.\n\n## Verify\n\nFive new tests drive the real binary: root not discovered, named block brings it back, public root, private root without workspaces, and private member all unchanged. A mutation that disables the rule fails the main test.\n\nTwo existing fixtures and one init test's scripted answers assumed the root was a package, so they were updated; the root is incidental to what they test.\n\n`just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0. CI was not run.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2092,"cache_read_input_tokens":497950,"output_tokens":1653,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":78},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2092,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":1653,"cache_read_input_toke