{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","prNumber":501,"prUrl":"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/pull/501","prRepository":"orin-dx/callisto","timestamp":"2026-11-10T20:31:50.028Z"}
{"parentUuid":"ee641370-19a1-43cb-841d-b97d750d6ec2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgutAxf7ZisHktDqhsXPt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#501's CI failures are fixed and pushed: all five local checks pass outside the sandbox, and the commit is signed. GitHub's CI is re-running now, and I haven't seen its result.\n\n**Three test fixes, all consequences of #500 and #502 merging, none from #501's own change**\n1. **Envelope test:** the helper expects the exit code the error's own code implies (2 for a usage code, otherwise 1), instead of a hard-coded 1.\n2. **Classification test:** E327 is a usage error, and E325, E326 and E328 are runtime.\n3. **#501's own unknown-key test:** it matched the old syntax-error variant. #500 moved unknown keys to `UnknownField` (E325), so the test now matches that variant. This is the swap the implementer predicted in its handoff.\n\n**Overlap with #503**\n- #503 makes the same two edits, plus E329 for its duplicate-package error. Whichever merges second will have a small conflict in the code-classification lists. I'll resolve it.\n- The envelope-helper edit is byte-identical in both, so git merges it cleanly.\n\n**Order now:** #503 and #501 can merge in either order. Tell me which landed, and I'll fix the one conflict on the other.\n\nneeds input: none. Please merge #501 and #503 when CI is green."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":650,"cache_read_input_tokens":821797,"output_tokens":432,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":650,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":432,"cache_read_input_tokens":821797,"cache_creation_input_tokens":650,"cache_c