{"parentUuid":"bc22ea5b-1ca7-460c-a8a9-aa72491e8ae4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgv5uJtVdEg6TXViUA1UL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The conflict on #503 is resolved and pushed. GitHub now shows it as mergeable, and it's blocked only on a review.\n\n- **The conflict:** a single line in the usage-error list in `crates/callisto-cli/src/error.rs`. #501 had added E327, and #503 adds E329. I kept both, and E327 appears once and E329 once.\n- **Everything else merged cleanly,** including the identical envelope-test fix that both branches carried.\n- **Checks:** all five pass outside the sandbox on the merged result, including the exit-code classification test with E325 to E329 classified. The merge commit is signed. CI hasn't run yet, so I can't say it's green on GitHub.\n\n#503 also repairs main's two red tests, so merging it should turn main green.\n\n**What's left:** this is the last of my open feature PRs. The only others are #495 (the changeset process docs) and #493 (the automated release PR for 0.20.0).\n\nneeds input: review and merge #503."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":652,"cache_read_input_tokens":828629,"output_tokens":321,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":652,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":321,"cache_read_input_tokens":828629,"cache_creation_input_tokens":652,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":652},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e1958f43-e2c2-403d-a491-a9c6e7e5d277","apiBlockInd