 updating the list deliberately. Do NOT change the action files. The repo's workflow policy check (.github/tests/verify-release-workflow-policy.sh) forbids new secrets and write permissions; your change must not need any.\n3. Exit codes 0/1/2: the classification test exists (crates/callisto-cli/tests/usage_exit_codes_tests.rs); only add a test if you find a promise gap, and report it.\n4. `callisto.toml`: a test already rejects an unknown key in every table (crates/callisto-graph/src/config/resolve.rs `every_config_table_rejects_an_unknown_key`); verify it still covers every table struct currently in config/ (a table added later must be caught: consider a test that fails when a config struct has no deny_unknown_fields) and add that guard if cheap.\n\nMutation check each new test. No code or action changes unless a test reveals a real bug (then stop and report it with evidence). Do NOT add a changeset (tests only). Do not commit, push or sign. Verify with `cargo test -p callisto-graph -p callisto-cli`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just workflow-contracts` judged by exit code (the sandbox blocks three network tests and gpg-signing in workflow-contracts; if so say so). Final report: per promise, what existed, what you added (test name and file), the mutation used, commands with exit codes, and anything you are unsure of."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"5cd8af54-84ad-48e2-ae3e-10ac41280718","apiBlockIndex":5,"requestId":"req_011CgwShjxUJ3RtKozBcncxt","requestRef":"58e959c1-2b69-467c-af35-fdf6f4fe77c2","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"2da05d41-c40c-4065-ac65-f4be328b8034","timestamp":"2026-11-11T16:19:53.903Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a528198a629670004","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.3