{"parentUuid":"82dca55d-0b0e-4247-9053-be984a002c0e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwUHN9ccrw13ecUpx4G2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AQd8vPmGWPKnZpHwS3ij2A","name":"Agent","input":{"subagent_type":"courier:pr-narrator","model":"sonnet","name":"pr504-body","description":"PR body for 504","prompt":"Write the title and body for a test-only pull request in the Callisto repo (a release tool heading to 1.0). Read the diff at /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr504.diff. Change: contract tests for stability promises in docs/stability.md that had no test. (1) Tag names: three tests run the real binary through `version`, `release plan` and `release execute` with fake publishers and read `git tag --list`: a unique package name is tagged `foo@1.1.0`, a name shared by two ecosystems is tagged `cargo/foo@1.1.0`, and `tag-template` overrides both. (2) GitHub Actions inputs: `.github/tests/verify-action-inputs.sh` pins each input's name, `required` and default for `callisto-action` (12 inputs) and `setup-callisto` (3) against checked-in lists, wired into the `workflow-contracts` recipe; removing, renaming or adding an input fails CI until the list is updated; it needs no secrets or permissions. (3) Exit codes: a test asserts clap parse errors (unknown flag, unknown subcommand, bad `--format`, missing argument) exit 2 in text and JSON mode, and `--help`, `status --help`, `--version` exit 0. (4) `callisto.toml`: a guard test fails if any config struct derives Deserialize without `deny_unknown_fields` (text scan of src/config, allowlisting one in-code-only type). Finding: `{name}` is not a `tag-template` placeholder (only `{version}`, as documented). No production or action code changed.\nVerified: a mutation per area fails its test (qualified-prefix join, ignoring tag-template, changing a setup-callisto default / renaming an input / adding one, Cli::parse replaced by a try_parse that exits 1, removing deny_unknown_fields from a config struct); `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0. Not run: CI. Limit: the unknown-field guard is a text scan and does not see a config struct defined outside src/config.\nStyle rules (strict): one line per paragraph, never hard-wrap; succinct and plain; no backstory, no filler, no emoji, no session links; sections \"## Summary\" and \"## Verify\"; under 200 words. Return only the title (conventional-commit style, lower case after the type) on the first line, a blank line, then the body."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":983,"cache_read_input_tokens":900629,"output_tokens":3310,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":164},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":983,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3310,"cache_read_input_tokens":900629,"cache_creation_input_tokens":983,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":983},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01AQd8vPmGWPKnZpHwS3ij2A":{"subagent_type":"courier:pr-narrator","model":"sonnet","name":"pr504-body","description":"PR body for 504","prompt":"Write the title and body for a test-only pull request in the Callisto repo (a release tool heading to 1.0). Read the diff at /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr504.diff. Change: contract tests for stability promises in docs/stability.md that had no test. (1) Tag names: three tests run the real binary through `version`, `release plan` and `release execute` with fake publishers and read `git tag --list`: a unique package name is tagged `foo@1.1.0`, a name shared by two ecosystems is tagged `cargo/foo@1.1.0`, and `tag-template` overrides both. (2) GitHub Actions inputs: `.github/tests/verify-action-inputs.sh` pins each input's name, `required` and default for `callisto-action` (12 inputs) and `setup-callisto` (3) against checked-in lists, wired into the `workflow-contracts` recipe; removing, renaming or adding an input fails CI until the list is updated; it needs no secrets or permissions. (3) Exit codes: a test asserts clap parse errors (unknown flag, unknown subcommand, bad `--format`, missing argument) exit 2 in text and JSON mode, and `--help`, `status --help`, `--version` exit 0. (4) `callisto.toml`: a guard test fails if any config struct derives Deserialize without `deny_unknown_fields` (text scan of src/config, allowlisting one in-code-only type). Finding: `{name}` is not a `tag-template` placeholder (only `{version}`, as documented). No production or action code changed.\nVerified: a mutation per area fails its test (qualified-prefix join, ignoring tag-template, changing a setup-callisto default / renaming an input / adding one, Cli::parse replaced by a try_parse that exits 1, removing deny_unknown_fields from a config struct); `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0. Not run: CI. Limit: the unknown-field guard is a text scan and does not see a config struct defined outside src/config.\nStyle rules (strict): one line per paragraph, never hard-wrap; succinct and plain; no backstory, no filler, no emoji, no session links; sections \"## Summary\" and \"## Verify\"; under 200 words. Return only the title (conventional-commit style, lower case after the type) on the first line, a blank line, then the body."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"535e2af2-9136-4a4e-ad06-d1819abee5a8","apiBlockIndex":3,"requestId":"req_011CgwUHMkp8MixXSWXzhbj1","requestRef":"f035e4ef-c460-4e3d-86d9-a7c888f4b0c7","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-