{"parentUuid":"927aec5b-5dc0-49fa-b3b3-08ed28d2f1a8","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"2a894959-123c-4c43-8372-1dc734ea2ed7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AQd8vPmGWPKnZpHwS3ij2A","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Spawned successfully. (This tool result is internal metadata — never quote or paste any part of it, including the ID below, into a user-facing reply.)\nagent_id: apr504-body-160722a5e7330536\nname: pr504-body\nThe agent is now running and will receive instructions via mailbox."}]}]},"uuid":"75befe1b-300c-4117-9457-4495c1d379c6","timestamp":"2026-11-11T16:40:07.578Z","toolUseResult":{"status":"teammate_spawned","prompt":"Write the title and body for a test-only pull request in the Callisto repo (a release tool heading to 1.0). Read the diff at /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr504.diff. Change: contract tests for stability promises in docs/stability.md that had no test. (1) Tag names: three tests run the real binary through `version`, `release plan` and `release execute` with fake publishers and read `git tag --list`: a unique package name is tagged `foo@1.1.0`, a name shared by two ecosystems is tagged `cargo/foo@1.1.0`, and `tag-template` overrides both. (2) GitHub Actions inputs: `.github/tests/verify-action-inputs.sh` pins each input's name, `required` and default for `callisto-action` (12 inputs) and `setup-callisto` (3) against checked-in lists, wired into the `workflow-contracts` recipe; removing, renaming or adding an input fails CI until the list is updated; it needs no secrets or permissions. (3) Exit codes: a test asserts clap parse errors (unknown flag, unknown subcommand, bad `--format`, missing argument) exit 2 in text and JSON mode, and `--help`, `status --help`, `--version` exit 0. (4) `callisto.toml`: a guard test fails if any config struct derives Deserialize without `deny_unknown_fields` (text scan of src/config, allowlisting one in-code-only type). Finding: `{name}` is not a `tag-template` placeholder (only `{version}`, as documented). No production or action code changed.\nVerified: a mutation per area fails its test (qualified-prefix join, ignoring tag-template, changing a setup-callisto default / renaming an input / adding one, Cli::parse replaced by a try_parse that exits 1, removing deny_unknown_fields from a config struct); `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0. Not run: CI. Limit: the unknown-field guard is a text scan and does not see a config struct defined outside src/config.\nStyle rules (strict): one line per paragraph, never hard-wrap; succinct and plain; no backstory, no filler, no emoji, no session links; sections \"## Summary\" and \"## Verify\"; under 200 words. Return only the title (conventional-commit style, lower case after the type) on the first line, a blank line, then the body.","agentId":"apr504-body-160722a5e7330536","resolvedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","teammate_id":"pr504-body@session-6cc3e47b","agent_id":"apr504-body-160722a5e7330536","agent_type":"courier:pr-narrator","model":"sonnet","name":"pr504-body","color":"blue","tmux_session_name":"in-process","tmux_window_name":"in-process","tmux_pane_id":"in-process","team_name":"session-6cc3e47b","is_splitpane":false,"plan_mode_required":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"535e2af2-9136-4a4e-ad06-d1819abee5a8","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a5e465e9b44611fbd","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a5e465e9b44611fbd","branch":"test/stability-contracts","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],