{"parentUuid":"11f80131-55d9-4bc9-98c1-fb01d50e9f86","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwULkqTw2fftc4b3EgEn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UKxkjXiLZb4VhXnVbyusHy","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr505_final.md","content":"## Summary\n\n`docs/stability.md` freezes `--format json` reports from 1.0 on the promise that every report carries `schemaVersion`, but nothing enforced it. An audit of every command's JSON success output found all of them already comply, so no report type changes.\n\nA table-driven test now runs the real binary for 21 invocations across two workspaces and asserts that stdout is valid JSON with a numeric top-level `schemaVersion`. For reports it also checks that `command` matches the documented name and `dryRun` is a bool. The test walks the clap command tree, hidden commands included. Each command must be in the table or in an explicit exempt list with a reason (`completions`, `help`, `schema`, `release build-python`), so a new command forces a decision.\n\n`docs/stability.md` gains one sentence: `release inspect` prints the intent, manifest or receipt unchanged, and `schema` prints JSON Schema documents, not reports.\n\nReported, not changed: the Action's inputs are snake_case and its outputs camelCase, and `schema` output has no `schemaVersion`.\n\n## Verify\n\nThe test makes no network calls: the fixture's GitHub-looking `origin` points at an unreachable local proxy.\n\n`just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0. A mutation making `matrix` print JSON without the envelope fails the new test. CI has not run. No changeset: tests and one doc sentence only.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1644,"cache_read_input_tokens":908143,"o