s://doc\n\n## Install\n\nRust:\n\n```bash\ncargo add michi-core\ncargo add michi-pipeline   # optional: async pipeline execution on Tokio\ncargo add michi-graph      # optional: dependency graphs (MIT, no dependencies)\n```\n\nNode.js:\n\n```bash\nnpm i @orin-dx/michi\n```\n\nThe npm package ships prebuilt native binaries for these platforms:\n\n- macOS on Apple silicon (`darwin-arm64`)\n- macOS on Intel (`darwin-x64`)\n- Linux x64 with glibc (`linux-x64-gnu`)\n9:| callisto-model | MIT | none (external: `michi-graph`, MIT) |\n15:- `callisto-model` (MIT) must never depend on an FSL crate. It depends on `michi-graph` (MIT, no dependencies of its own) for dependency-graph validation and ordering. `just license-boundary` fails if anything it builds with is FSL.\n1:[workspace]\n2:members  = [\n13:[workspace.package]\n23:[workspace.dependencies]\n61:[workspace.lints.rust]\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-aafeb13134f6a0ae4","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"855d5862-bf0e-4932-89c4-595333641e7f","timestamp":"2026-11-11T18:01:34.852Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"assets/\ncrates/\ndocs/\nevals/\nfuzz/\npackages/\nscripts/\nAGENTS.md  6.3K\nARCHITECTURE.md  7.4K\nCHANGELOG.md  2.2K\nCLAUDE.md  134B\nCODE_OF_CONDUCT.md  5.1K\nCONTRIBUTING.md  8.7K\nCargo.lock  27.2K\nCargo.toml  2.6K\nLICENSE  1.0K\nPRINCIPLES.md  9.1K\nREADME.md  9.2K\nSECURITY.md  3.3K\ncallisto.toml  1.3K\ndeny.toml  835B\njustfile  8.2K\nmoon.yml  1.2K\npackage.json  356B\npnpm-lock.yaml  7.7K\nrust-toolchain.toml  77B\n... (2 filtered)\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/orin-dx/michi/main/assets/brand/hero-dark.png\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/orin-dx/michi/main/assets/brand/hero-light.png\" alt=\"michi, an Orin DX tool\" width=\"360\">\n  </picture>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">道</p>\n\n[![CI](https://github.com/orin-dx/michi/actions/workflows/ci.yml/