11-11T18:37:13.125Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-aafeb13134f6a0ae4","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/json-contract-complete","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
{"parentUuid":"ca375a9d-7a29-4aab-af02-6590f98a42b3","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"4f144308-e30b-4671-99b2-6f9559f2c99a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FNgQvCoLEbPxpR44rjkiAi","type":"tool_result","content":" Time: 43ms ❯❯❯❯ to the moon\n\nNo projects affected — skipping lint.\nOPEN\ntest: assert every json success output carries a schemaVersion\n## Summary\n\n`docs/stability.md` freezes `--format json` reports from 1.0 on the promise that every report carries `schemaVersion`, but nothing enforced it. An audit of every command's JSON success output found all of them already comply, so no report type changes.\n\nA table-driven test now runs the real binary for 21 invocations across two workspaces and asserts that stdout is valid JSON with a numeric top-level `schemaVersion`. For reports it also checks that `command` matches the documented name and `dryRun` is a bool. The test walks the clap command tree, hidden commands included. Each command must be in the table or in an explicit exempt list with a reason (`completions`, `help`, `schema`, `release build-python`), so a new command forces a decision.\n\n`docs/stability.md` gains one sentence: `release inspect` prints the intent, manifest or receipt unchanged, and `schema` prints JSON Schema documents, not reports.\n\nReported, not changed: the Action's inputs are snake_case and its outputs camelCase, and `schema` output has no `schemaVersion`.\n\n## Verify\n\nThe test makes no network calls: the fixture's GitHub-looking `origin` points at an unreachable local proxy.\n\n`just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0. A mutation making `matrix` print JSON without the envelope fails the new test. CI has not run. No changeset: tests and one doc sentence only.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"1f9b7fe9-ccce-4147-b1e9-690de41c7538","timestamp":"2026-11-11T18:37:23.277Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":" Time: 43ms ❯❯❯❯ to the moon\n\nNo projects affected — skipping lint.\nOPEN\ntest: assert every json success output carries a schemaVersion\n## Summary\n\n`docs/stability.md` freezes `--format json` reports from 1.0 on the promise that every report carries `schemaVersion`, but nothing enforced it. An audit of every command's JSON success output found all of them already comply, so no report type changes.\n\nA table-driven test now runs the real binary for 21 invocations across two workspaces and asserts that stdout is valid JSON with a numeric top-level `schemaVersion`. For reports it also checks that `command` matches the documented name and `dryRun` is a bool. The test walks the clap command tree, hidden commands included. Each command must be in the table or in an explicit exempt list with a reason (`completions`, `help`, `schema`, `release build-python`), so a new command forces a decision.\n\n`docs/stability.md` gains one sentence: `release inspect` prints the intent, manifest or receipt unchanged, and `schema` prints JSON Schema documents, not reports.\n\nReported, not changed: the Action's inputs are snake_case and its outputs camelCase, and `schema` output has no `schemaVersion`.\n\n## Verify\n\nThe test makes no network calls: the fixture's GitHub-looking `origin` points at an unreachable local proxy.\n\n`just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0. A mutation making `matrix` print JSON without the envelope fails the new test. CI has not run. No changeset: tests and one doc sentence only.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"4205ead0-69c2-4238-abde-ed935077382c","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-aafeb13134f6a0ae4","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-aafeb13134f6a0ae4","branch":"fix/json-contract-complete","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"s