{"parentUuid":"c404dc0f-fa94-424e-a878-f42e05556c65","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwdFjCtzoVQdVZtCWzoS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PPh44maTg8quStJ92LDVhu","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr505_body.md","content":"## Summary\n\n`docs/stability.md` freezes `--format json` reports from 1.0 on the promise that every report carries `schemaVersion`. An audit of every command's JSON success output found all of them already comply, so no report type changes.\n\nThe `Report` trait already forces a `schema_version`, and `emit_report` is the one way to print a report. The only way around it was the public `write_json`, so it is now crate-private `write_document` (used by `release inspect`, which echoes the intent unchanged) and the error envelope goes through a new `write_error_json`. A command can no longer print a report without the envelope.\n\n`docs/stability.md` gains one sentence: `release inspect` prints the intent, manifest or receipt unchanged, and `schema` prints JSON Schema documents, not reports.\n\nReported, not changed: the Action's inputs are snake_case and its outputs camelCase, and `schema` output has no `schemaVersion`.\n\n## Verify\n\n`just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0. CI has not run. No changeset: no user-visible change.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":985,"cache_read_input_tokens":173557,"output_tokens":556,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":84},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":985,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":556,"cache_read_input_tokens":173557,"cache_creation_input_tokens":985,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":985},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01PPh44maTg8quStJ92LDVhu":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr505_body.md","content":"## Summary\n\n`docs/stability.md` freezes `--format json` reports from 1.0 on the promise that every report carries `schemaVersion`. An audit of every command's JSON success output found all of them already comply, so no report type changes.\n\nThe `Report` trait already forces a `schema_version`, and `emit_report` is the one way to print a report. The only way around it was the public `write_json`, so it is now crate-private `write_document` (used by `release inspect`, which echoes the intent unchanged) and the error envelope goes through a new `write_error_json`. A command can no longer print a report without the envelope.\n\n`docs/stability.md` gains one sentence: `release inspect` prints the intent, manifest or receipt unchanged, and `schema` prints JSON Schema documents, not reports.\n\nReported, not changed: the Action's inputs are snake_case and its outputs camelCase, and `schema` output has no `schemaVersion`.\n\n## Verify\n\n`just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0. CI has not run. No changeset: no user-visible change.\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"954df06c-3f6a-4fab-b765-82f9aa33b51b","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgwdFix24bsGNRrJKfhws","requestRef":"b62d00d2-6804-461e-ab1c-c108547a33f1","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"26f23670-1f44-4802-bd43-14e352415924","timestamp":"2026-11-11T18:37:27.181Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"c