{"parentUuid":"c166e52a-8afc-47ac-b7e6-eeb1cc04a3d1","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"4f144308-e30b-4671-99b2-6f9559f2c99a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0157N78rbLmHmhEzT3nb7M8c","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr504_body.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"3a91f5b0-c039-4c5d-98c0-120fbb66c563","timestamp":"2026-11-11T18:40:39.123Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr504_body.md","oldString":"unknown config keys are covered by behavior tests elsewhere.","newString":"unknown-key rejection (E325) has its own tests in `config/resolve.rs`.","originalFile":"## Summary\n\n`docs/stability.md` promises tag names and exit codes, and neither had a test. Changing them would break users silently, so this pins both with tests that run the real binary. Test-only, no production or action code changes.\n\n- Tag names: `version`, `release plan` and `release execute` run with fake publishers. A unique package is tagged `foo@1.1.0`, a name shared by two ecosystems `cargo/foo@1.1.0`, and `tag-template` overrides both.\n- Exit codes: clap parse errors exit 2 in text and JSON mode, and `--help`, `status --help` and `--version` exit 0.\n\n`{name}` is not a `tag-template` placeholder, only `{version}`, as documented.\n\nNot pinned here: the Action inputs and strict `callisto.toml` parsing. A shell script with text lists and a source-text scan were tried and dropped as the wrong tool; unknown config keys are covered by behavior tests elsewhere.\n\n## Verify\n\nA mutation per area fails its test: qualified-prefix join, ignoring `tag-template`, and `Cli::parse` swapped for a `try_parse` that exits 1. `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0. CI has not run.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":7,"oldLines":7,"newStart":7,"newLines":7,"lines":[" "," `{name}` is not a `tag-template` placeholder, only `{version}`, as documented."," ","-Not pinned here: the Action inputs and strict `callisto.toml` parsing. A shell script with text lists and a source-text scan were tried and dropped as the wrong tool; unknown config keys are covered by behavior tests elsewhere.","+Not pinned here: the Action inputs and strict `callisto.toml` parsing. A shell script with text lists and a source-text scan were tried and dropped as the wrong tool; unknown-key rejection (E325) has its own tests in `config/resolve.rs`."," "," ## Verify"," "]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c166e52a-8afc-47ac-b7e6-eeb1cc04a3d1","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"other"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a5e465e9b44611fbd","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"test/stability-contracts","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
