ollected during load and printed by the caller) through the existing load path. Do not introduce a new global, a new trait or a new parameter on many signatures; if the only fix needs one, stop and report instead. Keep stderr output byte-identical for the user-visible cases (find the tests that assert the note text and keep them passing; add one test only if no test covers the once-only behavior). Delete `note_once` and the static.\n\nREPORT (under 150 words): why it fired twice, what you changed, net lines, commit signed?, five verify results, anything unproven."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9181,"cache_read_input_tokens":213738,"output_tokens":9867,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2986},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9181,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":9867,"cache_read_input_tokens":213738,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9181,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9181},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01GVd2hZbSHdWGHPGSMNXqdC":{"description":"Remove note_once global state","subagent_type":"general-purpose","model":"sonnet","effort":"medium","isolation":"worktree","run_in_background":"true","prompt":"You work in an isolated git worktree of orin-dx/callisto (Rust release CLI). First: read AGENTS.md. Then `git fetch origin` and `git switch -c refactor/note-without-global origin/main`.\n\nHOUSE RULES (all mandatory)\n- Prefer types and the compiler over tests; delete before adding; no speculat