{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","bridgeSessionId":"cse_013R2ytxL4nYq1T7cJBdRjiu","lastSequenceNum":11704,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"67457012-557c-4542-8add-d3d6ad6e0743","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgwma8wpfjVfUWbmHmRre","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The bug-fix branch holds up on review, and I've sent its agent after five similar sites it didn't cover.\n\n**What I checked:** `fix/subdir-diff-and-pre-tags` is one signed commit and its five repo checks exit 0, per the agent. Both fixes are small and correct.\n- **Subdirectory diff:** the `changed.rs` specs now use `rev:./dir`. The new real-git test failed before the fix.\n- **`pre enter` tags:** `semver::Prerelease::new` replaces the hand-written grammar, so `01` and `beta.01` are now rejected, and the rstest table covers the accepted and rejected tags.\n\n**What I found beyond the report:** five other sites build `rev:path` specs from `normalized_git_path`, which returns a workspace-relative path with no `./`. They are in `release_decision.rs` (`git_file`, `batch_manifest_blobs_at`) and `version.rs` (`prefetch_head_manifests`, `head_has_pending_changeset`, `manifest_blob_at`). In a subdirectory workspace they likely resolve from the repo top, the same bug as the one fixed. Only `version_commit.rs` already uses `./`. I haven't run any of them yet.\n\n**What the agent is doing:** it will run the real binary in a repo with the workspace at `r1/ws` against those sites. It will fix and test only the ones that are actually wrong, on the same branch, and report back.\n\nStill running: that follow-up, `exit_kind` and the deletions. The `note_once` item stays dropped unless you say otherwise.\n\nneeds input: none yet."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4619,"cache_read_input_tokens":257970,"output_tokens":534,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache