{"parentUuid":"85767a4e-ef77-4818-b951-3b689cfa4e95","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgwmumkfh5XDaLR1UXejq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01D3n8BQRyea1cPfFPjtdapU","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_docs.md","content":"## Summary\n- Adds an \"Enforcing an invariant\" section to AGENTS.md. It tells agents to pick the first rung that works: a type or private constructor, an exhaustive `match` on our own enums, a lint already in the workspace, one small test that drives the real binary or function, or nothing.\n- It also rules out tests that scan source text, hand-maintained lists that mirror code, hand-written grammars when a crate in `Cargo.lock` already does the job, and freely adding error codes, JSON keys or flags (permanent after 1.0).\n- Why: the 0.20 stability batch shipped shell scripts plus text files, a source-text scan, a 21-invocation test that duplicated a trait guarantee, and a 230-string code list. Agents were never told to prefer types, so they reached for text checks.\n\n## Type of change\n- [x] Documentation only\n\n## Changeset\n- [x] None needed: contributor docs only.\n\n## Docs\n- [x] AGENTS.md is the only file changed; no spec, `docs/config.md` or `docs/errors.md` change applies.\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] `just doc-check` and `just pre-push` exit 0\n- [ ] Not run: CI\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3228,"cache_read_input_tokens":285146,"output_tokens":2083,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":223},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3228,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2083,"cache_read_input_tokens":28514