{"parentUuid":"e1d2d50f-4e07-4931-9f8e-9e83fa69176e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwnDpsx9Jx5hD7BFXh4H","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LDpzJS8tyGvwXaWhhZJENw","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"PR text for bug-fix branch","subagent_type":"courier:pr-narrator","model":"sonnet","effort":"low","prompt":"Write a PR title and body for orin-dx/callisto branch `fix/subdir-diff-and-pre-tags` (base main), using the repo template .github/pull_request_template.md sections (Summary, Type of change, Changeset, Docs, Test Plan). Diff: `git diff origin/main...origin/fix/subdir-diff-and-pre-tags` (run from /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3264fad8587e83c7; do not cd elsewhere). Facts: two bugs. (1) When the callisto workspace is a subdirectory of the git repo (repo/ws), git resolves `rev:path` object specs from the repository top, not the cwd, so `changed_since_last_tag` compared two missing objects as equal and `status` reported changedSinceLastTag false for packages with committed changes; the release preview lost uncovered-change warnings. Fixed with `rev:./dir` in changed.rs, and the same latent problem at five sibling sites (git_file, batch_manifest_blobs_at, prefetch_head_manifests, head_has_pending_changeset, manifest_blob_at) via one shared `object_at(rev, path)` helper in release_decision.rs. (2) `pre enter 01` and `beta.01` were accepted but `version` then failed with E035; the dotted tag check now uses `semver::Prerelease::new` (semver already a workspace dependency, added to callisto-graph), rejecting them with E324. Tests: real-git test with the workspace at r1/ws, fails before the fix (changed.rs); a real-git `check_partial_run_refuses_in_a_workspace_below_the_repository_root` test fails when the helper is reverted (version.rs sites); an rstest table for the tag grammar. Changesets: new `.changeset/status-in-subdirectory-workspace.md` (patch); the leading-zero tag note is folded into the unreleased `catch-bad-input-early.md`. Verify: just pre-push, lint, doc-check, test, workflow-contracts exit 0. Not proven: the real binary was not run from a subdirectory workspace; the two release_decision.rs sites have no dedicated regression test (covered by the shared helper); CI has not run. Rules: succinct, plain, one line per paragraph (never hard-wrap), no emoji, no AI slop, no session links or Claude trailers. Return JSON per your contract."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":909,"cache_read_input_tokens":305673,"output_tokens":1098,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":909,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1098,"cache_read_input_tokens":305673,"cache_creation_input_tokens":909,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":909},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01LDpzJS8tyGvwXaWhhZJENw":{"description":"PR text for bug-fix branch","subagent_type":"courier:pr-narrator","model":"sonnet","effort":"low","prompt":"Write a PR title and body for orin-dx/callisto branch `fix/subdir-diff-and-pre-tags` (base main), using the repo template .github/pull_request_template.md sections (Summary, Type of change, Changeset, Docs, Test Plan). Diff: `git diff origin/main...origin/fix/subdir-diff-and-pre-tags` (run from /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3264fad8587e83c7; do not cd elsewhere). Facts: two bugs. (1) When the callisto workspace is a subdirectory of the git repo (repo/ws), git resolves `rev:path` object specs f