0 locally\n- [x] A real-git test with the workspace at `r1/ws` in `changed.rs` fails before the fix. A real-git `check_partial_run_refuses_in_a_workspace_below_the_repository_root` test fails when the helper is reverted. An rstest table covers the tag grammar, including `01` and `beta.01`.\n- [ ] Not proven: the real binary was not run from a subdirectory workspace, and the two `release_decision.rs` sites have no dedicated regression test (they use the shared helper). CI has not run.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3fd75503-09a1-45f9-9dd7-ecae0b326a46","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"other"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3264fad8587e83c7","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/subdir-diff-and-pre-tags","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
