{"parentUuid":"29b3167e-0a1c-4026-be01-c3d01db6f3f0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgwpL4SgLPnFFNi8bHcdC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two read-only agents are running, both Sonnet at medium effort and neither editing anything:\n\n- **Duplicate workspace load:** finds every command path that loads the workspace more than once. For each it asks whether the second load is needed, how small the fix is, and what it costs on a large workspace. It also checks whether removing the redundant loads would make `note_once` unnecessary.\n- **Docs versus code drift:** checks the 1.0 contract in `docs/stability.md` against real `--format json` output, `docs/errors.md` against the codes in the code, `docs/config.md` against the config structs, the schemas, and `--help` text. The old audit found about 14% of spec criteria false or partly true.\n\nI held off on the `changed.rs` rewrite and the error-code scanner collapse because they depend on #511 and #508, which are still open (#493 is blocked as well). The local `NEXT-WORK.md` still describes 0.14, so I'll rewrite it from these results.\n\nneeds input: none. I'll bring back both reports, verified against the code, with a ranked next-work list."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3663,"cache_read_input_tokens":315859,"output_tokens":350,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3663,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":350,"cache_read_input_tokens":315859,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3663,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3663},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d919af18-705d-4bb7-ba6b-f81e2d936d88","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgwpL3yeW18vVgfsK1mFz","requestRef":"10afb777-4ef3-4442-83a6-c8e962d26a5a","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"cbc1c386-778f-4f91-a3ab-3b27e7f52056","timestamp":"2026-11-11T21:02:40.087Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/agent-a3264fad8587e83c7","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/subdir-diff-and-pre-tags","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
