{"parentUuid":"db0c902c-07b6-4ae5-9261-2c8f52c4a8eb","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"PreToolUse:Bash","toolUseID":"toolu_01BYypMD4X7Sc8yeY5VDtmFp","hookEvent":"PreToolUse","content":"","stdout":"{\"hookSpecificOutput\":{\"hookEventName\":\"PreToolUse\",\"permissionDecisionReason\":\"RTK auto-rewrite\",\"updatedInput\":{\"command\":\"sed -n 1303,1318p crates/callisto-graph/src/config/resolve.rs; rtk read .changeset/catch-bad-input-early.md\"}}}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"rtk hook claude","durationMs":16},"type":"attachment","uuid":"09c31509-6f33-49fb-bdd6-e9dffd7b2056","timestamp":"2026-11-11T21:25:48.999Z","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/drop-false-inference-alias","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/drop-false-inference-alias","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
{"parentUuid":"0cfe9fa6-1811-4a66-96e8-b2c4657cfa74","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6b7c858c-20ba-40c0-9e3d-ce3a9d0561be","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BYypMD4X7Sc8yeY5VDtmFp","type":"tool_result","content":"    fn parse_release_trigger_rejects_unknown_string() {\n        assert!(parse_release_trigger(\"sometimes\").is_none());\n    }\n\n    #[test]\n    fn parse_pre_major_policy_parses_all_known_variants() {\n        assert_eq!(parse_pre_major_policy(\"off\").unwrap(), PreMajorInferencePolicy::Off);\n        assert_eq!(parse_pre_major_policy(\"false\").unwrap(), PreMajorInferencePolicy::Off);\n        assert_eq!(\n            parse_pre_major_policy(\"conservative\").unwrap(),\n            PreMajorInferencePolicy::Conservative\n        );\n        assert_eq!(\n            parse_pre_major_policy(\"conservative-feat\").unwrap(),\n            PreMajorInferencePolicy::ConservativeFeat\n        );\n---\ncallisto-cli: minor\n---\n\nMistyped config keys and pre-release tags are caught where you make them.\n\n- An unknown key inside a `[[fixed-group]]` or `[[linked-group]]` block now fails with an error naming the key. Before, it was silently ignored.\n- `callisto pre enter` rejects a tag with a space, `!`, `/`, an empty part or a number with a leading zero such as `01` (E324) and writes nothing. Before, it wrote `pre.json` and `version` failed later with a confusing version error. Dotted tags such as `beta.1` still work.\n\nAction: if a group block in `callisto.toml` carries a key Callisto does not recognise, remove it.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"f9c39135-4e18-41ad-a5be-b598198902cf","timestamp":"2026-11-11T21:25:50.967Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"    fn parse_release_trigger_rejects_unknown_string() {\n        assert!(parse_release_trigger(\"sometimes\").is_none());\n    }\n\n    #[test]\n    fn parse_pre_major_policy_parses_all_known_variants() {\n        assert_eq!(parse_pre_major_policy(\"off\").unwrap(), PreMajorInferencePolicy::Off);\n        assert_eq!(parse_pre_major_policy(\"false\").unwrap(), PreMajorInferencePolicy::Off);\n        assert_eq!(\n            parse_pre_major_policy(\"conservative\").unwrap(),\n            PreMajorInferencePolicy::Conservative\n        );\n        assert_eq!(\n            parse_pre_major_policy(\"conservative-feat\").unwrap(),\n            PreMajorInferencePolicy::ConservativeFeat\n        );\n---\ncallisto-cli: minor\n---\n\nMistyped config keys and pre-release tags are caught where you make them.\n\n- An unknown key inside a `[[fixed-group]]` or `[[linked-group]]` block now fails with an error naming the key. Before, it was silently ignored.\n- `callisto pre enter` rejects a tag with a space, `!`, `/`, an empty part or a number with a leading zero such as `01` (E324) and writes nothing. Before, it wrote `pre.json` and `version` failed later with a confusing version error. Dotted tags such as `beta.1` still work.\n\nAction: if a group block in `callisto.toml` carries a key Callisto does not recognise, remove it.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"classifierBoundary":true,"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"8564739c-4daa-48c3-adb6-59df5eb37911","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/drop-false-inference-alias","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/drop-false-inference-alias","branch":"fix/drop-false-inference-alias","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/drop-false-inference-alias","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxViolations":[],"sandboxed":true,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0cfe9fa6-1811-4a66-96e8-b2c4657cfa74","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/drop-false-inference-alias","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/drop-false-inference-alias","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
