{"parentUuid":"2751fe71-9213-4b1e-ba43-819d016ef895","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6b7c858c-20ba-40c0-9e3d-ce3a9d0561be","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011LBcs2GCK7daqCsmBEz7jW","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_alias.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"55cca6f8-72b1-4424-8eb8-6d720230d244","timestamp":"2026-11-11T21:29:28.106Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/pr_alias.md","content":"## Summary\n- `pre-major-inference = \"false\"` was accepted as `off` in `parse_pre_major_policy`, but `docs/config.md` and the help for E256 list only `off`, `conservative` and `conservative-feat`. This removes the undocumented alias so it does not become a permanent part of the 1.0 surface.\n- A config that sets `\"false\"` now fails with E256 naming the three valid values. The test that asserted the alias now asserts the rejection.\n- The note goes in the unreleased `catch-bad-input-early.md` entry, which already covers mistyped config values.\n- Decision for the owner: this removes a value that previously worked. If you prefer to keep it, close this and document the alias in `docs/config.md` instead.\n\n## Type of change\n- [x] Bug fix\n\n## Changeset\n- [x] Added to the unreleased `.changeset/catch-bad-input-early.md`.\n\n## Docs\n- [x] None needed: `docs/config.md` and E256 already list the three valid values.\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] `just pre-push`, `just lint`, `just doc-check`, `just test` and `just workflow-contracts` exit 0 locally\n- [ ] Not run: CI\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"bc29b3bc-c873-4148-a09f-4d9d7535cd59","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/drop-false-inference-alias","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/drop-false-inference-al