{"parentUuid":"a0afe2c8-e881-4666-9b49-36287dbfd959","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b706e7e6-e876-4cc7-a28e-db9a5557f989","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"change #224 has an insight: \n\n<pasted_content id=\"6d4c\">\n### Medium finding\n\n**Location:** `crates/semantic/src/convert.rs:399-402`\n\nFor a component taking `Props<string>`, where `interface Props<T> extends React.HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement> { value: T }`, the instantiated interface has only reference flags, so `states_bases` rejects it and this traversal stops. The resulting empty list replaces the structural composition (`crates/semantic/src/component.rs:188-189`, `crates/core/src/types/semantic.rs:337`), losing `HTMLAttributes` from the output. Follow the generic target during this name-only traversal to retain its React bases.\n</pasted_content id=\"6d4c\">\n"},"uuid":"aafdfc50-339b-49a2-b196-c9245147dc8c","timestamp":"2026-11-11T22:11:42.103Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"typed","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":219,"turnIndex":298},"sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/drop-false-inference-alias","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/drop-false-inference-alias","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
