{"parentUuid":"20e4f4e6-32a5-4254-aea1-8298ede037f6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgwuo8tPw9a8f4XGGCHvH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, and it's safe: there are 22 worktrees and 36 local branches, and most belong to PRs that have merged. I haven't deleted anything, because you earlier asked me to keep the work while your review agents ran. I'd like your go first, since three worktrees are locked and need force.\n\n**Keep (still in use)**\n- The main checkout.\n- `drop-false-inference-alias` (#515, open), `changeset-process` (#495, open), and the `callisto/version-packages` branch (#493).\n\n**Remove: 15 agent worktrees whose PRs merged**\n- Worktrees whose PRs merged: #501, #503–#514, using the original agents' worktrees for #501, #504 and #507.\n- Locked, so removing them needs `--force --force`: the `fix/input-validation` (#501), `fix/error-envelope` and `fix/note-once` worktrees, plus `fix/subdir-diff-and-pre-tags` (#511).\n- Not found in merged PRs: `fix/error-envelope` and `fix/note-once`. Both were superseded or dropped earlier, so I'd confirm they have no unpushed work before forcing them.\n- `refactor/note-without-global` (the stopped agent) never got a worktree commit and just has an empty local branch.\n\n**Local branches:** this repo is squash-merge only, so `git branch --merged` can't tell merged branches from unmerged ones. I'd delete each local branch only after `gh` confirms its PR merged, and keep the open-PR ones. The auto-named `worktree-agent-*` branches go with their worktrees.\n\n**Not mine, your call:** four worktrees in `~/Projects/callisto-fixtures/` (`wt-cleanup-1/2/3`, `clean-cleanup`) hold older cleanup branches (`chore/callisto-dead-code` and others). I haven't checked their state, so I'd leave them unless you say otherwise.\n\n**Remote branches:** I'd leave deleting merged branches on `origin` to you, as before. I can give you the list.\n\nneeds input: say go and I'll remove the merged worktrees and local branches (including forcing the locked ones after checking they hold nothing unpushed), or name any to keep."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1377,"cache_read_input_tokens":410839,"output_tokens":1287,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":557},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1377,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1287,"cache_read_input_tokens":410839,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1377,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1377},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c64f43ea-48ec-46f0-b562-83a9acf731f8","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cgwuo8cnAWeMd1oks5cWW","requestRef":"20075192-0648-4fac-99af-8a7c47d03dab","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"7f67115e-0a40-47a2-a706-abb4733cd13e","timestamp":"2026-11-11T22:14:29.394Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/drop-false-inference-alias","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/drop-false-inference-alias","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
