nd for the second branch also `sh /Users/gabe/.claude/jobs/6cc3e47b/tmp/verify.sh .` run with dangerouslyDisableSandbox: true, all five PASS). Do NOT open PRs.\n\nCONTEXT: Dependabot PR #516 (branch `dependabot/github_actions/routine-actions-ef6b953f05`) bumps `taiki-e/install-action` from 2.88.0 to 2.90.1 in four workflow files but NOT in the composite action `.github/actions/install-workflow-linters/action.yml`, so `.github/tests/verify-action-pins.sh` fails (\"an action is pinned to more than one commit\": 86f7a0ffb25f40114606501a311ebcfaf882ea32 vs c509219cf42fba86913069efd0ade2458c59337b). Dependabot skips composite actions because `.github/dependabot.yml` does not list their directory.\nTASK 1 (branch of #516): `git fetch origin dependabot/github_actions/routine-actions-ef6b953f05`, `git switch -c fix-pin origin/dependabot/github_actions/routine-actions-ef6b953f05`. Update the `taiki-e/install-action@<sha> # v2` line in `.github/actions/install-workflow-linters/action.yml` to the same SHA and the same trailing comment style the bumped workflow files now use (look at them). Run `just workflow-contracts` (exit 0). Commit signed (`ci: pin install-action to the same commit in the linters composite action`) and push to that Dependabot branch: `git push origin HEAD:dependabot/github_actions/routine-actions-ef6b953f05`. Check that also `grep -rn 'uses:.*@' .github/actions` shows no other action pinned to a different commit than the workflows use.\nTASK 2 (separate branch off origin/main, `ci/dependabot-composite-actions`): edit `.github/dependabot.yml` so the github-actions ecosystem also updates the composite actions under `.github/actions/` (documented GitHub syntax: `directories:` list with `/` and `/.github/actions/*`; keep the existing groups, schedule and labels). Keep the diff minimal. Verify with the verify script, push `git push -u origin ci/dependabot-composite-actions`.\nTASK 3 (read-only): Dependabot PR #517 (`dependabot/cargo/routine-crates-db76e0ed47`): `gh pr checks 517` and `gh run view <run> --log-failed` for any failing job; report why it fails (do not fix).\nREPORT (under 150 words): both pushed commits (signed?), workflow-contracts exit, any other mismatched pins, #517 failure cause.","outputFile":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8/tasks/afeeec2434ad98e88.output","canReadOutputFile":true,"canContinueAgent":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"07d346d2-b968-4910-85b8-dae630fce803","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/drop-false-inference-alias","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/drop-false-inference-alias","branch":"fix/drop-false-inference-alias","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"orin-dx/callisto","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/drop-false-inference-alias","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"bd26ade8-2912-4791-b379-5b5f67406ff5","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/drop-false-inference-alias","sessionId":"6cc3e47b-8406-4c17-94fb-22313682fad8","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"fix/drop-false-inference-alias","slug":"mossy-snacking-stream"}
